<view class="page"><view class="notice"><view class="notice-title">退出前会先预览影响</view><view class="notice-text">比赛中和已结束的场次保持不变；仅取消并重新安排尚未开始的对阵，组织者确认后才会生效。</view></view><view wx:for="{{event.participants}}" wx:key="id" class="card participant {{item.status === 'WITHDRAWN' ? 'withdrawn' : ''}}"><view class="participant-copy"><view class="name"><text class="number">{{item.participantNumber}}</text>{{item.nickname}}</view><view class="meta">{{item.gender === 'MALE' ? '男' : '女'}} · {{item.level || '未填写水平'}}</view></view><button wx:if="{{item.status !== 'WITHDRAWN'}}" class="exit-button" size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" loading="{{submittingId === item.id}}" disabled="{{!!submittingId}}" bindtap="withdraw">退出并重排</button><text wx:else class="exited-badge">已退出</text></view></view>


